The following third-party components are shipped with, or fetched on
demand by, this package. Full license texts are reproduced in the
LICENSE.note file at the package root, and copies of the font licenses
accompany the fonts in inst/fonts/.

Only Lete Sans Math is bundled inside the installed package. Latin
Modern Math, STIX Two Math, and TeX Gyre DejaVu Math are downloaded on
demand by download_math_font() from the package's GitHub releases. All
three are still redistributed by this project and therefore listed
here.

